# React (Trufi)

- Functional components; Context + hooks for state.
- Tailwind v4; Framer Motion in admin UI.
- Feature gates: `usePlan()` + `src/config/plans.ts` — never hardcode tier checks.
- Admin components use `@file` JSDoc headers — preserve when editing.
- Match existing naming and file layout; reuse utils/contexts.
